# The names of a callable's parts answer in its code (the author 2026-11-11,
# LMX_blog/2026-11-11.md#callable-parts-visibility; plan M11 5b): the parts are fields of the callable.
# args has been merged with data (LMX_blog 2026-11-15): there is no part named args any more, so the bare name
# args in the code is not a part, and length(args) is refused with 3 (the pinned answer: exit 1, obligatory 1, answer 3).
fn: f (int: a 1; int: b 2) int
    return: length(args)
end: f
int: seen f()
